   potential and the power conversion efficiency of non-equilibrium light
   absorption by a thermostated material. Application of our results for
   the case of electron migration from valence to conduction bands in
   photovoltaic cells allows us to accurately interpolate experimental
   results for the maximal efficiencies of Ge-, Si-, GaAs-based cells and
   the like. (C) 2017 Author(s). All article content, except where
