Pages = {49-54},
Month = {MAR},
Abstract = {A new diagnosis of Americanura Cassagnau, 1983 is done and a discussion
   on the genus' morphology is presented. A new species of the genus, from
   Chiapas State, Mexico, is described and illustrated; it is characterized
   by the fusion and reduction of the antenno-frontal tubercle and the
   highest reduction of its setae. A complement to the description of A.
   mexicana Cassagnau, 1983 is done including the morphological variation.},
