   Electronicos Electricos Morelos A C; CIICAq; IEEE VTS},
Abstract = {In this paper we are interested in knowing, if a filter and a feature
   selection are used, the action recognition is improved. In the filter
   phase, Kalman filter and Savitzky-Golay filter are proposed to analyse
   skeleton acquired by the Kinect, in order to minimize the noise. In the
   phase of feature selection, the algorithm Reduction of Feature
   Dimensions based on Standard Deviation (RFD-SD) {[}1] and Principal
   Component Analysis(PCA) are proposed to select the relevant set of
   features. The obtained results suggest that action recognition improves
   by using Kalman filter and the algorithm RFD-SD.},
